Dheweke meh ngiler.

575
00:16:59,633 --> 00:17:00,500
Dheweke mesthi bakal teka tuku.

576
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:01,866
Aku malah ora duwe cukup kanggo aku dhewe.

577
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,066
Saiki ora ana sing entuk apa-apa.

578
00:17:04,266 --> 00:17:05,533
Pengawas, ana wong sing njaluk sowan.

579
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:06,366
Sapa kuwi?

580
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:08,200
Dheweke kandha yen dheweke saka Gunung Panya.

581
00:17:08,466 --> 00:17:09,166
Lebokna dhèwèké.

582
