Sanajan utusan ora bakal diukum mati.

619
00:18:07,833 --> 00:18:08,966
Aku utusan saka Gunung Panya

620
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,866
Aku teka nggawa hadiah lan kabecikan.

621
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:10,800
Kok wani-wanine kowe ngina aku!

622
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:12,700
