625
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:15,933
apa ora kuwi...

626
00:18:15,966 --> 00:18:16,966
Dhèwèké ora diutus déning Tie Shan.

627
00:18:17,566 --> 00:18:18,400
Dudu Tie Shan.

628
00:18:21,133 --> 00:18:21,933
Aku yakin

629
