Kuwi ora cocog.

638
00:18:35,066 --> 00:18:37,300
Sing nduweni motif lan paling semangat
kanggo males dendam marang kita

639
00:18:37,333 --> 00:18:38,133
yaiku Yaogule.

640
00:18:38,633 --> 00:18:40,166
Kita nyerbu bètèngé, klan kulawarga Yao.

641
00:18:40,266 --> 00:18:41,400
Ora ana sing luwih kepengin kita mati tinimbang dheweke.

642
00:18:41,733 --> 00:18:42,500
Bener.

643
00:18:43,166 --> 00:18:44,600
Nanging yen Yaogule ngirim pasukan

644
00:18:44,733 --> 00:18:46,033
Ngapa kok kudu ngibarké panji-panjiné Tie Shan?

645
00:18:46,166 --> 00:18:47,500
Lan kenapa kok ngirim wong kanggo nuntut perdamaian?

646
00:18:50,133 --> 00:18:51,233
Kuwi kuncine sing sejatine.

647
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,533
Yen pancen Tie Shan sing ngirim

648
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:55,166
Bab pisanan sing bakal ditindakake yaiku ngresiki jenenge dhewe

649
