Saya dheweke ngindhari, saya jelas yen
dheweke dudu anak buahe Tie Shan.

657
00:19:07,833 --> 00:19:09,800
Nyoba nyalahké Tie Shan kabèh.

658
00:19:09,833 --> 00:19:11,100
Ayo lawan Tie Shan nganti rampung.

659
00:19:11,433 --> 00:19:13,000
Dhèwèké, Yaogule, mung éntuk keuntungané.

660
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:14,400
Persis.

661
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:15,700
Dhèwèké njaluk limang èwu tael.

662
00:19:15,966 --> 00:19:17,000
Menawi kita nampi,

663
00:19:17,033 --> 00:19:18,300
Dheweke banjur bisa ngaku marang jagad iki

664
00:19:18,433 --> 00:19:19,933
Tentara Longcheng Xiang, sing ngalahake dheweke kaping pindho,

665
00:19:19,966 --> 00:19:21,033
