666
00:19:21,066 --> 00:19:21,833
Malah luwih gedhe prestise.

667
00:19:22,166 --> 00:19:23,133
Yen kita ora nampa

668
00:19:23,266 --> 00:19:24,733
Sing bakal kita lawan uga Tie Shan.

669
00:19:24,833 --> 00:19:25,633
Dhèwèké ora ana hubungane karo kuwi.

670
